`bansaldeepak/Realtime-Avatar` is a direct clone (not a GitHub fork) of `Panya-Labs/MuseTalk`.
Git remote `upstream` configured pointing to `https://github.com/Panya-Labs/MuseTalk.git`.

To push branches and create PRs on the original repo:
```bash
git push upstream <branch-name>
gh pr create --repo Panya-Labs/MuseTalk --base main --head <branch-name>
```

Private repo — fork setting was off on GitHub, so standard fork workflow unavailable.
